Description: Dell PERC RAID controller CLI (Broadcom MegaRAID storcli, rebadged)
 Provides the perccli command for querying and managing Dell PERC
 (Broadcom MegaRAID) RAID controllers -- virtual/physical disk status,
 RAID level, cache policy, BBU health.
